# Keep the build context limited to inputs referenced by Dockerfile. Runtime
# configuration, credentials, workspaces, documentation, and repository
# metadata are mounted or used outside the image and must not be uploaded.
*
!Dockerfile
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!packages/
!packages/**
!python/
!python/**

# Dependencies and build products are recreated in the image.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
packages/core/python/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Python caches and local packaging/test artifacts are not build inputs.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/
